    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/48ba1fd047c44133b74893014397b916.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Show. Try Not to Die.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cirque de Slay</i> is a turn-based multiplayer horror roguelike set in a cursed carnival, where light is a commodity and your friends are never truly on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, players take turns exploring this twisted circus, looting gear, avoiding traps, and racing to find the boss. But while one player explores, the others spectate... and interfere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectators play sinister cards that alter the active player\u2019s run in real time, spawning enemies, closing doors, flipping traps, or stealing their loot. No run is ever safe\u2026 and no victory is ever guaranteed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/4eb1f1d208f78dab1992c942104636b5.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7f300f068ef2c55f71cad9e366c641fb.poster.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7f300f068ef2c55f71cad9e366c641fb.webm?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7f300f068ef2c55f71cad9e366c641fb.mp4?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-taking Multiplayer Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Up to four players alternate daring runs through blood-soaked floors and nightmarish attractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/d400274102894c4c05ef8c410c8613ea.poster.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/d400274102894c4c05ef8c410c8613ea.webm?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/d400274102894c4c05ef8c410c8613ea.mp4?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator Sabotage</strong> \u2013 Influence the game even when you're not playing with a deck of chaos-inducing cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/2bb2ea7ce766b11bdda1f8054e637c67.poster.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/2bb2ea7ce766b11bdda1f8054e637c67.webm?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/2bb2ea7ce766b11bdda1f8054e637c67.mp4?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Procedural Carnival</strong> \u2013 Explore ever-changing, trap-filled arenas inspired by grotesque circus attractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/a0ebaf96fbc298a19aea38b14cc1af3c.poster.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/a0ebaf96fbc298a19aea38b14cc1af3c.webm?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/a0ebaf96fbc298a19aea38b14cc1af3c.mp4?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot, Upgrade, Survive</strong> \u2013 Scavenge powerful gear, manage your stamina, and prepare for a climactic boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7d37d5b9830d09d1d6374cdbba612005.poster.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7d37d5b9830d09d1d6374cdbba612005.webm?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7d37d5b9830d09d1d6374cdbba612005.mp4?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only One Can Win</strong> \u2013 The first player to defeat the boss takes all. Everyone else gets... the curtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it out alive... or become part of the show?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/48ba1fd047c44133b74893014397b916.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Show. Try Not to Die.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cirque de Slay</i> is a turn-based multiplayer horror roguelike set in a cursed carnival, where light is a commodity and your friends are never truly on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, players take turns exploring this twisted circus, looting gear, avoiding traps, and racing to find the boss. But while one player explores, the others spectate... and interfere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectators play sinister cards that alter the active player\u2019s run in real time, spawning enemies, closing doors, flipping traps, or stealing their loot. No run is ever safe\u2026 and no victory is ever guaranteed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/4eb1f1d208f78dab1992c942104636b5.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=102 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7f300f068ef2c55f71cad9e366c641fb.poster.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7f300f068ef2c55f71cad9e366c641fb.webm?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7f300f068ef2c55f71cad9e366c641fb.mp4?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-taking Multi