com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/a0ebaf96fbc298a19aea38b14cc1af3c.poster.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/a0ebaf96fbc298a19aea38b14cc1af3c.webm?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/a0ebaf96fbc298a19aea38b14cc1af3c.mp4?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot, Upgrade, Survive</strong> \u2013 Scavenge powerful gear, manage your stamina, and prepare for a climactic boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7d37d5b9830d09d1d6374cdbba612005.poster.avif?t=1748008477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7d37d5b9830d09d1d6374cdbba612005.webm?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/7d37d5b9830d09d1d6374cdbba612005.mp4?t=1748008477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only One Can Win</strong> \u2013 The first player to defeat the boss takes all. Everyone else gets... the curtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it out alive... or become part of the show?</p>",
    "short_description": "Cirque de Slay is a competitive online action-roguelike for up to four players, set in a twisted carnival. Build decks, play cards, and twist the rules to challenge your opponents as they scavenge for loot, evade traps, and hunt down the boss to escape\u2026 choose your friends wisely.",
